ion 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nJacob is very organized and likes to schedule events in his Calender. Originally, he and his girlfriend, Stephanie, were planning on a date this afternoon, so he scheduled his whole day around it. At noon, Stephanie messaged him that since She didn't have anything for the day, her friends invited her to a fabulous birthday party that she will go to.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Jacob ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Disappointment\nB) Delight\nC) Jealousy\nD) Embarrassment\nE) Gratitude\nF) Curiosity\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Jacob feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) His girlfriend forgot about their schedule\nB) His girlfriend decided to spend time with others instead of him\nC) His girlfriend is preparing a surprise for their date\nD) His girlfriend is going to a fun party","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577486174021013,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6ba9aa9dc5a833d99f0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483898823,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:44:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"916b052c4eb64f5b94cb07d553560375"}